AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     The aattuu driver was written by Daan Vreeken and ported to OpenBSD by Theo
     de Raadt and David Gwynne.

CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     The aattuu driver does not support a lot of the functionality available in
     the hardware.  More work is required to properly support the IBSS, power
     management, and selectable transmission rate features.

